# The frontend runs standalone by DEFAULT: an in-browser knowledge engine with a real
# embedded corpus powers Ask BHUMI, Topic Intelligence and the Report Engine — no server.
# You normally need NO environment variables at all for the demo.

# To point the app at a live FastAPI backend instead of the in-browser engine, set BOTH:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_MODE=false
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.your-backend.example.com
# (Setting only NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL does nothing — demo mode stays on so the site never
#  calls a backend that isn't there.)
